  "intro": "The Clubs at Quantico offers a Chef-designed menu for lunch, dinner, and holiday events. The Officers/SNCO Club (Pub) is open to all and offers a relaxing and fun pub-like atmosphere filled with USMC mementos. Our event space is expansive and offers many amenities to meet your needs for weddings, balls, meetings, and professional/personal occasions. The Clubs at Quantico also offers full-service catering and is the perfect partner for all your events. We look forward to serving you!",
